{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21976","headline":"杏园中枣树 · 白居易","name":"杏园中枣树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人言百果中，唯枣凡且鄙。\n皮皴似龟手，叶小如鼠耳。\n胡爲不自知，生花此园里。\n岂宜遇攀玩，幸免遭伤毁。\n二月曲江头，杂英红旖旎。\n枣亦在其间，如嫫对西子。\n东风不择木，吹喣长未已。\n眼看欲合抱，得尽生生理。\n寄言游春客，乞君一回视。\n君爱绕指柔，从君怜柳杞。\n君求悦目艳，不敢争桃李。\n君若作大车，轮轴材须此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}